{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06377","headline":"题卢道士房 · 李颀","name":"题卢道士房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋砧响落木，共坐茅君家。\n惟见两童子，林前汲井华。\n空坛静白日，神鼎飞丹砂。\n麈尾拂霜草，金铃摇霁霞。\n上章人世隔，看[弈]桐阴斜。\n稽首问仙要，黄精堪饵花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}